              <object>
                <lexicalForm>This is the distribution in RDF/Turtle of the INAIL ontology about self-payment, the process by which an employer subject to compulsory insurance against occupational accidents and diseases pays the annual insurance premium</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
